     "type": "heading",
     "version": 1,
     "tag": "h2"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "detail": 0,
       "format": 0,
       "mode": "normal",
       "style": "",
       "text": "We welcomed our second baby boy in March. He is an(other) angel, and I love him with every bit of my heart. We’ve started going to swimming “lessons” once a week. The big one is doing great as well, and I try to get in some sport at least once a week.",
       "type": "text",
       "version": 1
      }
     ],
     "direction": null,
     "format": "",
     "indent": 0,
     "type": "paragraph",
     "version": 1,
     "textFormat": 0,
     "textStyle": ""
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "detail": 0,
       "format": 0,
       "mode": "normal",
       "style": "",
       "text": "After feeding ten years of notes, thoughts and hours of monologue about my life, projects, friends and more into Claude, I had a small epiphany: I need to focus on what I’m genuinely best at, the things that feel like play to me but like work to others aka my superpowers. Yes, kind of obvious. But actually living it is a big deal for me.",
       "type": "text",
       "version": 1
      }
     ],
     "direction": null,
     "format": "",
     "indent": 0,
     "type": "paragraph",
     "version": 1,
     "textFormat": 0,
     "textStyle": ""
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "detail": 0,
       "format": 0,
       "mode": "normal",
       "style": "",
       "text": "So for the next few months, I will only:",
       "type": "text",
       "version": 1
      }
     ],
     "direction": null,
     "format": "",
     "indent": 0,
     "type": "paragraph",
     "version": 1,
     "textFormat": 0,
     "textStyle": ""
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        {
         "detail": 0,
         "format": 0,
         "mode": "normal",
         "style": "",
         "text": "share inspiring, exciting and interesting things in a monthly newsletter, plus a few more blog posts",
         "type": "text",
         "version": 1
        }
       ],
       "direction": null,
       "format": "",
       "indent": 0,
       "type": "listitem",
       "version": 1,
       "value": 1
      },
      {
       "children": [
        {
         "detail": 0,
         "format": 0,
         "mode": "normal",
         "style": "",
         "text": "write and illustrate a comedy book for DerMartin.de",
         "type": "text",
         "version": 1
        }
       ],
       "direction": null,
       "format": "",
       "indent": 0,
       "type": "listitem",
       "version": 1,
       "value": 2
      },
      {
       "children": [
        {
         "detail": 0,
         "format": 0,
         "mode": "normal",
         "style": "",
         "text": "do AI consulting for entrepreneurs",
         "type": "text",
         "version": 1
        }
       ],
       "direction": null,
       "format": "",
       "indent": 0,
       "type": "listitem",
       "version": 1,
       "value": 3
      }
     ],
     "direction": null,
     "format": "",
     "indent": 0,
     "type": "list",
     "version": 1,
     "listType": "bullet",
     "start": 1,
     "tag": "ul"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "detail": 0,
       "format": 0,
       "mode": "normal",
       "style": "",
       "text": "Together with Claude, I’ve set up a clear work schedule, which helps a lot for an always-distracted squirrel like me. My days already feel more fulfilled and happier.",
       "type": "text",
       "version": 1
      }
     ],
     "direction": null,
     "format": "",
     "indent": 0,
     "type": "paragraph",
     "version": 1,
     "textFormat": 0,
     "textStyle": ""
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "detail": 0,
       "format": 0,
       "mode": "normal",
       "style": "",
       "text": "I may have picked a bad moment to step away from daily trading, or at least from staring at the charts. Or maybe not. The coming months will tell.",
       "type": "text",
       "version": 1
      }
     ],
     "direction": null,
     "format": "",
     "indent": 0,
     "type": "paragraph",
     "version": 1,
     "textFormat": 0,
     "textStyle": ""
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "detail": 0,
       "format": 0,
       "mode": "normal",
       "style": "",
       "text": "Also:",
       "type": "text",
       "version": 1
      }
     ],
     "direction": null,
     "format": "",
     "indent": 0,
     "type": "paragraph",
     "version": 1,
     "textFormat": 0,
     "textStyle": ""
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        {
         "detail": 0,
         "format": 0,
         "mode": "normal",
         "style": "",
         "text": "Planning our holidays for 2027, possibly Thailand.",
         "type": "text",
         "version": 1
        }
       ],
       "direction": null,
       "format": "",
       "indent": 0,
       "type": "listitem",
       "version": 1,
       "value": 1
      },
      {
       "children": [
        {
         "detail": 0,
         "format": 0,
         "mode": "normal",
         "style": "",
         "text": "I’ve had some joint pain in my arms, but I’m slowly getting back into it: running my boy to kindergarten once or twice a week and doing some exercise.",
         "type": "text",
         "version": 1
        }
       ],
       "direction": null,
       "format": "",
       "indent": 0,
